Hurricane Sandy in a future climate,” </span><em id="bib.bib3.4" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:70%;">Sustainability</em><span id="bib.bib3.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">, vol. 12, 2020.
